    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really?? i thought it was just a standard cough medicine. is it actually that risky? i feel like i can't even sleep with this cough, i'm exhausted. is there anything else i can take that is strong enough to stop it but won't mess with my sertraline? maybe a different brand or just a higher dose of something?",
