      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't really have time to go to the doctor right now i work two jobs and it's so expensive. i just need something that works tonight so i can sleep. if i just took a slightly smaller dose of the dextromethorphan, would that make it safer? or is there like a different medicine i can just grab at the 24hr pharmacy that's really strong and won't cause any problems with my meds?",
